title: Scheduled Task Registered (4698)
id: 3637a8ad-74bc-44ca-8423-a7feabe34633
status: experimental
description: Detects registration of a new scheduled task (event 4698), a persistence and execution mechanism; suspicious actions/paths in the task definition increase confidence.
author: Alaris Global
references:
  - https://attack.mitre.org/techniques/T1053/005/
logsource:
  product: windows
  service: security
detection:
  selection:
    EventID: 4698
  condition: selection
fields:
  - SubjectUserName
  - TargetUserName
  - IpAddress
falsepositives:
  - Software installers creating tasks
level: medium
tags:
  - attack.persistence
  - attack.t1053.005
